  "description": "Scheduled jobs for GM.FileStorage.Catalog on GM.Scheduling: delete the bytes queued for cleanup (every minute), purge files deleted longer ago than a retention period (hourly), and check stored bytes against their records (every 5 minutes). One call registers them for your app's stored-file and cleanup aggregates; batch sizes and retention come from configuration. Part of the GM.FileStorage family.",
